{"html":"<header class=\"spec-title-strip\">\n<div class=\"spec-title-col\">\n<div class=\"spec-family-crumb\">\n            FAMILY 10 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">生成模型：从潜变量与对抗学习到 diffusion、flow 与 consistency</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Generative, Diffusion &amp; Flow</span>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"spec-model-title\" id=\"model_063_rectified_flow-title\">Rectified Flow</h3>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-text lang-zh\">以直线端点路径训练 velocity，并通过 reflow 重新耦合端点以进一步拉直 ODE 轨迹。</p>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-en lang-en\">Learns an ODE velocity field along straight linear interpolations x_t = (1−t)x_0 + t x_1 and iteratively straightens trajectories via reflow recoupling.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-tensor-col\">\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">INPUT DOMAIN // 输入域</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">源噪声 z0 与目标数据 x1 的 coupling</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Coupled pairs (x_0, x_1) from source distribution π_0 and target distribution π_1</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">OUTPUT TARGET // 输出目标</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">沿近直线 ODE 少步运输得到的样本 x_hat</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Nearly straight-line ODE transport trajectories enabling high-fidelity 1-to-few-step Euler generation</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</header><div class=\"model-full-body\">\n<!-- Main Split: Original Figure Plate (Left) + Forward Computation Graph (Right) -->\n<div class=\"spec-blueprint-grid\">\n<section class=\"spec-figure-plate\">\n<div class=\"plate-header\">\n<div class=\"plate-header-left\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">PRIMARY FIGURE // Figure 2 · PDF p.4</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">论文原始方法示意图</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Original Paper Architecture Diagram</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"plate-header-right\">\n<a class=\"plate-source-link\" href=\"https://mlanthology.org/iclr/2023/liu2023iclr-flow/\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>SOURCE PDF</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n<button class=\"plate-zoom-btn\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_063_rectified_flow')\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6M9 21H3v-6M21 3l-7 7M3 21l7-7\"></path></svg><span>FULLSCREEN LIGHTBOX</span></button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<figure class=\"arch-figure-box\" data-call-click=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_063_rectified_flow')\" title=\"Click to open interactive pan &amp; zoom viewer\">\n<img alt=\"Rectified Flow original paper architecture figure, Figure 2\" class=\"arch-figure-img\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/fc2dc5b4a9271c2d1ccd.avif\"/>\n<figcaption class=\"plate-caption\">CLICK FIGURE TO OPEN INTERACTIVE PAN &amp; ZOOM VIEWER · Figure 2 · PDF p.4</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</section>\n<aside class=\"spec-circuit-panel\">\n<div class=\"circuit-header\">\n<div>\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">COMPUTATION GRAPH // 10 STAGES</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">架构前向计算节点拆解</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Forward Pass Computation Nodes</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"circuit-controls\">\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_063_rectified_flow', -1)\" title=\"Previous Stage\" type=\"button\">◁</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn circuit-play-btn\" data-play-id=\"architecture_model_063_rectified_flow\" data-call-click=\"toggleAutoPlayNodes('architecture_model_063_rectified_flow')\" title=\"Auto-Trace Computation Graph\" type=\"button\">AUTO</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" data-call-click=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_063_rectified_flow', 1)\" title=\"Next Stage\" type=\"button\">▷</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"active-node-spotlight\" id=\"spotlight-architecture_model_063_rectified_flow\">\n<span class=\"spotlight-badge\">\n                STAGE 01 / 10 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">源噪声 z0</span><span class=\"lang-en\">noise z0</span>\n</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text lang-zh\">标准高斯等 base sample</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text spotlight-text-en lang-en\">Ingests coupled pairs (x_0, x_1) from source distribution π_0 and target distribution π_1 and prepares initial tensor representations (noise z0).</span>\n</div>\n<ol class=\"circuit-timeline\">\n<li class=\"circuit-node active\" data-node-desc=\"标准高斯等 base sample\" data-node-desc-en=\"Ingests coupled pairs (x_0, x_1) from source distribution π_0 and target distribution π_1 and prepares initial tensor representations (noise z0).\" data-node-idx=\"0\" data-node-name=\"源噪声 z0\" data-node-name-en=\"noise z0\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_063_rectified_flow', 0)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">01</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">源噪声 z0</span><span class=\"lang-en\">noise z0</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">标准高斯等 base sample</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Ingests coupled pairs (x_0, x_1) from source distribution π_0 and target distribution π_1 and prepares initial tensor representations (noise z0).</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"数据分布样本\" data-node-desc-en=\"Executes objective x1 to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.\" data-node-idx=\"1\" data-node-name=\"目标 x1\" data-node-name-en=\"objective x1\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_063_rectified_flow', 1)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">02</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">目标 x1</span><span class=\"lang-en\">objective x1</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">数据分布样本</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Executes objective x1 to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"配对 z0 与 x1；配对质量决定交叉轨迹复杂度\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs coupling within the core straightened transport ode computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"2\" data-node-name=\"初始 coupling\" data-node-name-en=\"coupling\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_063_rectified_flow', 2)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">03</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">初始 coupling</span><span class=\"lang-en\">coupling</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">配对 z0 与 x1；配对质量决定交叉轨迹复杂度</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs coupling within the core straightened transport ode computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"x_t=(1-t)z0+t x1，目标速度为 x1-z0\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Stage 04 within the core straightened transport ode computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"3\" data-node-name=\"直线前向路径\" data-node-name-en=\"Stage 04\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_063_rectified_flow', 3)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">04</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">直线前向路径</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Stage 04</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">x_t=(1-t)z0+t x1，目标速度为 x1-z0</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Stage 04 within the core straightened transport ode computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"回归 E[x1-z0|x_t]；目标为 velocity 而非 score\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs velocity field v_theta within the core straightened transport ode computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"4\" data-node-name=\"速度场 v_theta\" data-node-name-en=\"velocity field v_theta\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_063_rectified_flow', 4)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">05</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">速度场 v_theta</span><span class=\"lang-en\">velocity field v_theta</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">回归 E[x1-z0|x_t]；目标为 velocity 而非 score</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs velocity field v_theta within the core straightened transport ode computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"dx/dt=v_theta(x,t)，从噪声积分到数据\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Rectified ODE within the core straightened transport ode computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"5\" data-node-name=\"Rectified ODE\" data-node-name-en=\"Rectified ODE\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_063_rectified_flow', 5)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">06</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Rectified ODE</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">dx/dt=v_theta(x,t)，从噪声积分到数据</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Rectified ODE within the core straightened transport ode computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"用当前 ODE 将 z0 映射为 x1_hat，形成新 coupling\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Stage 07 within the core straightened transport ode computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"6\" data-node-name=\"生成端点对\" data-node-name-en=\"Stage 07\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_063_rectified_flow', 6)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">07</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">生成端点对</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Stage 07</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">用当前 ODE 将 z0 映射为 x1_hat，形成新 coupling</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Stage 07 within the core straightened transport ode computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"在新端点对上重训，使轨迹进一步变直、减少交叉\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Reflow within the core straightened transport ode computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"7\" data-node-name=\"Reflow\" data-node-name-en=\"Reflow\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_063_rectified_flow', 7)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">08</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Reflow</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">在新端点对上重训，使轨迹进一步变直、减少交叉</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Reflow within the core straightened transport ode computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"直轨迹可用 Euler 等粗步长积分，甚至蒸馏为单步\" data-node-desc-en=\"Applies Stage 09 to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.\" data-node-idx=\"8\" data-node-name=\"少步求解\" data-node-name-en=\"Stage 09\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_063_rectified_flow', 8)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">09</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">少步求解</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Stage 09</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">直轨迹可用 Euler 等粗步长积分，甚至蒸馏为单步</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Applies Stage 09 to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"ODE 终点生成样本\" data-node-desc-en=\"Produces nearly straight-line ode transport trajectories enabling high-fidelity 1-to-few-step euler generation via x_hat.\" data-node-idx=\"9\" data-node-name=\"x_hat\" data-node-name-en=\"x_hat\" data-call-click=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_063_rectified_flow', 9)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">10</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>x_hat</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">ODE 终点生成样本</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Produces nearly straight-line ode transport trajectories enabling high-fidelity 1-to-few-step euler generation via x_hat.</span></div></li>\n</ol>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<!-- Mathematical Formalism Band -->\n<section aria-label=\"Rectified Flow Mathematical Formalism\" class=\"spec-math-band\">\n<div class=\"math-meta-col\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">MATHEMATICAL FORMALISM</span>\n<div class=\"math-title-text lang-zh\">核心公式 · 直线速度目标与 reflow 重新耦合</div>\n<div class=\"math-title-en lang-en\">Core Formalism · Linear Interpolation Velocity Matching &amp; Iterative Reflow Trajectory Straightening</div>\n</div>\n<div aria-label=\"Rectified Flow：核心公式 · 直线速度目标与 reflow 重新耦合\" class=\"tex-formula-vector\" role=\"img\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" data-formula-index=\"63\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"12.247708pt\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" style=\"display:block;width:auto;max-width:100%;height:auto;max-height:96px;margin:0 auto\" version=\"1.1\" viewbox=\"-69.279199 -69.000129 347.222582 12.247708\" width=\"347.222582pt\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><defs><path d=\"M2.937924-4.24808H2.143891L2.421802-5.270398C2.431728-5.290249 2.431728-5.3101 2.431728-5.320025C2.431728-5.389503 2.401952-5.419279 2.352324-5.419279C2.292772-5.419279 2.262996-5.409354 2.203443-5.32995C1.260528-4.099198 .565749-4.307632 .565749-3.990019C.565749-3.980093 .565749-3.960242 .575674-3.930466H1.310155L.595525-1.200976C.565749-1.071945 .367241-.456569 .367241-.267986C.367241-.049627 .575674 .10918 .843661 .10918C1.30023 .10918 1.627769-.168732 2.25307-1.091796L2.12404-1.161274C1.637694-.535973 1.478888-.377166 1.320081-.377166C1.230752-.377166 1.1712-.456569 1.1712-.575674C1.1712-.5856 1.1712-.595525 1.181125-.625301L2.054562-3.930466H2.888297L2.937924-4.24808Z\" id=\"m063_g14-67\"></path><path d=\"M4.228229-3.79151C4.228229-4.109124 3.970168-4.37711 3.672405-4.37711C3.444121-4.37711 3.305165-4.24808 3.305165-4.039646C3.305165-3.880839 3.364717-3.761734 3.543375-3.602927C3.6724